<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JUD" style="id">- Oyda New Testament</book>
  <para style="h">Yihuda</para>
  <para style="toc1">Yihuda Xaafide Kiita</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yihuda</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yihu.</para>
  <para style="mt1">Yihuda Xaafide Kiita</para>
  <para style="imt1">Gele</para>
  <para style="ip">Yihuda kiita xaafinttide, ammananxi yezitera ammanze asi aazii worddo timirtte dalggize asuntsappa ammanze asuntsi naaginttode gaar qofissades. Hyay hyaata kiitize fa gidda aykkide qoftta lam7intsa Phexiroosa kiita aazane. Xaafize, «Ammanze asuntsis fettii tohen wurssutsi yellodes ingginttide ammanos olinttote» yaga7i nabbabizuntsana mintsii qofizane.</para>
  <para style="iot">Aafe Qofuntsi</para>
  <para style="io1">Saritse <char style="ior"><ref loc="JUD 1:1-2">1-2</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Worddo asttamaarunts timirttiton un gol7ito <char style="ior"><ref loc="JUD 1:3-16">3-16</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Ammano naagode fana ingginttide zore <char style="ior"><ref loc="JUD 1:17-23">17-23</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Galata woosa <char style="ior"><ref loc="JUD 1:24-25">24-25</ref> </char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JUD 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JUD 1:1"/>Taanii Yihuda, Yesuus Kiristtoosa arize, Yayqooba ishay;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JUD 1:1">Xoozii xeegiduntsis, Xoozze Aday kadhizuntsin Yesuus Kiristtoosas naaginttiduntsis hyay kiitiza xaafida.<verse eid="JUD 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JUD 1:2"/>Maarotitsi, sarotitsin siiqon yinttis gaanggo.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 13:55">Maato. 13:55</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:3">Mar. 6:3</ref></char></note><verse eid="JUD 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Worddo asttamaaruntsana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JUD 1:3"/>Ta siiqo ishuntso, nuunii wolla shaakkinttize atotitsiti baz yinttis xaafodes taanii gaama amudhdhida. Yezin ammanze asuntsis fettii tohen lam7intsaames ingginttide ammano gisho olinttode gaar yinttana zoritera xaafodanna taas koshshize baz maaqqida. <verse eid="JUD 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JUD 1:4"/>Gaama wodeppa tiino un firddita xaafintti bettide, fettii fettii asuntsi oonin erikaayzin aachintti yin gidda gelida. Un Xoozza eroosuntsana, un nu Xoozzes aadho keehatitsito tuna oocha hyanttodes maaddinttize oge mahi ekkane. Fa xalaala kaati maaqqide, nu Laatstse Yesuus Kiristtoosa kaddane.<verse eid="JUD 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JUD 1:5"/>Yezin yin hyanno ubba erizebaz maaqqikon, Laatstsi Isra7eele asuntsi Gibxxe sa7appa wayzi kessezako, mahi suubappa ammanoosuntsana dhabsidanno ta yinttana qofissades koyane. <verse eid="JUD 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JUD 1:6"/>Fa yeze bestto ashshii, faas ingginttide adetits wolqqito naagikaayze kiitanchchuntsana, damma firdda qamma yellodes Xoozii unttana dhumappa oomora medhina santsalaatara accii gaddida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:51">Keze 12:51</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 14:29-30">Faydo 14:29-30</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JUD 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JUD 1:7"/>Yinnii gaar, Soodoman Gamoora asuntsi un kale yeze katama asuntsara olale hyanttida; un medho woga baayze olale oochchida. Un medhina tamar firddinttoduntsis aazize maaqqida.<verse eid="JUD 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JUD 1:8"/>Yinnii fanan, yentsi asuntsi abukkora fa galtto tunizane; adetits wolqqara yezuntsana borane; salo bonchcho yezuntsanan cazhane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:1-24">Medho 19:1-24</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JUD 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JUD 1:9"/>Yezin kiitanchchuntsi hyalaqa Mika7eele Muse ahas Xalahera lallide wode «Laatstsii nena seero» yagayda fattin eella afa cashshi qaala ohi mootodes koykaaya. <verse eid="JUD 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JUD 1:10"/>Yezin hyantsi asuntsi faas eroosse baz ubba cazhane; mahi un wozina baayze hyaars fana medho qofara erizebazi yezikon, iza unttana dhabsoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 10:13">Dane. 10:13</ref>, <ref loc="DAN 10:21">21</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 12:1">12:1</ref>; <ref loc="REV 12:7">Qon. 12:7</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 34:6">Mahe 34:6</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 3:2">Zakka. 3:2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JUD 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JUD 1:11"/>Unttana bade! Un Qaa7ela oge hyanggida. Miishe koyi Balaama balidanne gol7ida. Qore ixxidanni fana unttin Xoozalla denddii dhabida.<verse eid="JUD 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JUD 1:12"/>Hyantsi asuntsi, siiqo zhagana bessa yinttara bettize wode yeella baayze borinttiduntsana. Un fana xalaala yenggizuntsana. Un zhuubba kanggize ira baayze dhonne fana. Mahi aafe wode aafe baayze, xaphora shodinttide, lam77i tohe melide minxa fana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 4:3-8">Medho 4:3-8</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 22:1-35">Faydo 22:1-35</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 16:1-35">16:1-35</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JUD 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JUD 1:13"/>Un mintsi abba zuluntte gaar fa yeella oochchar dubbizuntsana. Un medhina linxi yiide dhuma naagize waayinttize xoolinttuntsana.<verse eid="JUD 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JUD 1:14"/>Addaamappa dentsii, laappuntso yeletitsi maaqqide Heenokan, hyantsi asuntsbaz tinbbite ohittera, «Yikke, Laatstsii, fa gaama mukul geeshshuntsara ye7oda. <verse eid="JUD 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JUD 1:15"/>Asuntsana ubba firddoda; genuntsana ubba un oochchide iita oochiti ubba gishon genetitsara un Xoozzella afa ohinttide iita ohiti ubba gisho firddoda» gayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 5:18">Medho 5:18</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 5:21-24">21-24</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JUD 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JUD 1:16"/>Yentsi asuntsi ubba wode zuuzinggizuntsanan ohe koyzuntsana. Mahi fa iita amotitsito kaallane; fana ceeqqanen fana maaddize baz denggodes melluntsana nashshane.<verse eid="JUD 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wurssutsi zore</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JUD 1:17"/>Yezin ta ishuntso, nu laatstse Yesuus Kiristtoosa hawaaruntsi zaga yinttis ohide qaaltto qoppote. <verse eid="JUD 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JUD 1:18"/>Un, «Wurssutsi wodite, Xoozze qofa ashshii fa iita amotitsi kaallii Xooz toochizuntsi ye7oda» gayda. <verse eid="JUD 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JUD 1:19"/>Yentsi asuntsi as gidda shaako medhdhizuntsana, fa asho amotitsis aqizuntsana Geeshi Ayyaana baayzuntsana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2PE 3:3">2 Phex. 3:3</ref></char></note><verse eid="JUD 1:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JUD 1:20"/>Yezin ta ishuntso, geeshi maaqqide yin ammantte yinttana Ayyaanar dichchodes minggote; mahi Geeshi Ayyaana wolqqa woossote. <verse eid="JUD 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JUD 1:21"/>Yinttana medhina de7o yeltsize nu Laatstse Yesuus Kiristtoosa maarotitsi naagitera yinttana Xoozze siiqite naagote.<verse eid="JUD 1:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JUD 1:22"/>So7ize asuntsis yiqsinttote. <verse eid="JUD 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JUD 1:23"/>Fettii fettii asuntsana tamappa kessii ekkote. Melluntsis nagarara tunide un galtto bochchide afultto ixxittera zhashimora maarote.<verse eid="JUD 1:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Galatan woosan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JUD 1:24"/>Yin gol7aame fana naagodesin bore baayzuntsana mahi damma ufayssara kumide tiino shiishodes dandda7ize, <verse eid="JUD 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JUD 1:25"/>nuna ashshize fettii Xoozze, nu Laatstse Yesuus Kiristtoosa baggara bonchchon, dammatetsi, wolqqan adetits wolqqa, zagappa aykkii, hyatten, medhina ees maaqqe. Amin77e.<verse eid="JUD 1:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JUD 1"/>
</usx>
